n\n**#56833** - SafeGatewayPlugin crashes on code 1005 when abortSignal fires (maxAttempts=0 sentinel collision)\n- **类型**：bug + crash\n- **严重度**：高（abortSignal 时崩溃）\n- **root cause**：`maxAttempts: 0` 用作停止信号，但 `>=` 检查不能区分\n- **影响**：abortSignal 触发时崩溃而不是优雅退出\n- **可修性**：S（有明确的修复建议）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复（添加 `maxAttempts === 0` guard 或使用专用 sentinel）\n\n#### P2 - 中优先级问题\n\n**#56844** - [Bug] 2026.3.24 版本输出消息换行符被强制合并，段落空行丢失\n- **类型**：bug\n- **严重度**：中（影响可读性）\n- **root caus\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1586-L1616","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1586-L1616"},{"id":"ac8c4717c64afb58c60021e54d00536b847272295f7b6ce8a377603593fc0a53","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":164,"endLine":211,"score":0.5430654933617012,"textScore":0.5430654933617012,"snippet":"- **root cause**：Feishu TTS 语音消息应发送为 audio 类型，但当前实现发送为 file 类型\n- **影响**：\n  1. Feishu 用户无法正常接收语音消息\n  2. TTS 功能体验差\n- **可修性**：S（修改消息类型即可）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\n\n#### InStreet 社区发现\n\n无（域名解析失败，无法访问）\n\n#### Discord 社区发现\n\n无（Discussions 404）\n\n#### 插件仓库发现\n\n无（openclaw-weixin 仓库不存在或无法访问）\n\n---\n\n## 2026-03-31 15:00 UTC 扫描\n\n### 扫描摘要\n- **时间范围**：2026-03-31 13:00 UTC → 15:00 UTC（过去 120 分钟）\n- **新 open issues**：32 个（已排除已覆盖项）\n- **新 open PRs**：~50 个\n- **状态**：发现 1 个 P0 级别严重问题，2 个 P1 级别问题，5 个 P2 级别问题\n\n### 关键发现\n\n#### P0 - Critical 问题\n\n**#58409** - [Bug]: [CRITICAL] Heartbeat System Causes Silent Session Reset - User Data Loss\n- **类型**：bug + data loss\n- **严重度**：极高（静默会话重置，用户数据丢失）\n- **root cause**：Hear\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L164-L211","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L164-L211"},{"id":"f63e4d09358acca5ed8420091ce8e9f46ff55e61e41c598ff6ec5f31068ad548","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":1125,"endLine":1155,"score":0.5356872815545249,"textScore":0.5356872815545249,"snippet":"- **可修性**：S（修复 allowlist 逻辑，bundled channels 应该被豁免）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n**#57215** - [Bug]: image tool does not resolve relative paths aga