*推荐**：不 action（社区建设事项）\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\n\n---\n\n## 2026-03-30 06:55 UTC 扫描\n\n### 扫描摘要\n- **时间范围**：2026-03-30 04:55 UTC → 06:55 UTC（过去 120 分钟）\n- **新 open issues**：85 个（已排除已覆盖项）\n- **状态**：发现 2 个 P0 级别严重问题，4 个 P1 级别问题，1 个 P2 级别问题\n\n### 关键发现\n\n#### P0 - Critical 问题\n\n**#57551** - [Bug]: kimi无限递归重试，把我模型token都跑光了\n- **类型**：bug + regression\n- **严重度**：极高（edit 工具参数错误导致无限重试，耗尽 token）\n- **root cause**：edit 工具返回\"Missing required parameters: path alias, oldText alias, newText alias\"错误，但触发无限递归重试\n- **影响**：\n  1. 升级到 2026.3.28 后，edit 工具失效\n  2. 无限重试导致 token 被耗尽\n  3. 用户报告 2 小时后台 token 被刷爆\n- **可修性**：M（需要修复 kimi provider 的参数验证和错误处理逻辑）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复（立即处理）\n- **log snippet**：`[tools] ed\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L751-L784","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L751-L784"},{"id":"4e392ca1d2a9ea0b501dffde39a6029ee8b421b2191e4f9356cbd547291b9a77","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":1328,"endLine":1369,"score":0.532399417886314,"textScore":0.532399417886314,"snippet":"- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n**#57138** - Mission Control: Add collapsible/responsive task view\n- **类型**：enhancement\n- **严重度**：低（UX 改进）\n- **root cause**：Mission Control 缺少可折叠/响应式任务视图\n- **影响**：用户体验不够便利\n- **可修性**：M\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n**#57123** - Feature: Incremental/adaptive inbound message debounce\n- **类型**：enhancement\n- **严重度**：低（功能改进）\n- **root cause**：缺少增量/自适应入站消息去抖动\n- **影响**：消息处理效率\n- **可修性**：M\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n**#57119** - Feature Request: Enforce skill execution sandbox when enabled: false\n- **类型**：enhancement\n- **严重度**：低（功能改进）\n- **root cause**：sandbox 配置未正确执行\n- **影响**：安全性\n- **可修性**：M\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n**#57118** - config.patch cannot set scalar leaf values; hooks.internal.entries.* unpatchable\n- *\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1328-L1369","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1328-L1369"},{"id":"3d834f4e46f1c9edd1730e889d986797a8528abc3caba2c017177fd169d7db79","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":720,"endLine":762,"score":0.5310955454157532,"textScore":0.5310955454157532,"snippet":"- **来源**：GitHub issues\n\n#### P2 - Medium 优先级问题\n\n**#57557**` - subagents/runs.json read on every RPC call causes O(n) gateway latency\n- **类型**：bug + performance\n- **严重度**：中（性能问题）\n- **root cause**：每次 RPC 调用都读取 subagents/runs.json，导致 O(n) latency\n- **影响**：\n  1. Gateway 响应变慢\n  2. 频繁 RPC 调用时性能下降明显\n- **可修性**：M\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\n\n**#57555** - Built-in skill 'summarize' only supports brew install, no feedback when enable fails\n- **类型**：bug + docs gap\n- **严重度**：中（用户体验问题）\n- **root cause**：'summarize' skill 只支持 brew install，Linux/非-macOS 系统启用失败无反馈\n- **影响**：\n  1. 非 macOS 用户无法使用 summarize skill\n  2. 无明确的错误提示\n- **可修性**：S\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\n\n**#57549** - OpenClaw\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L720-L762","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L720-L762"},{"id":"d3adb8cdea186b2794b71d99b809938010659b8f8774bb5e60ead057976ea78c","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":1687,"endLine":1724,"score":0.5310955454157532,"textScore":0.5310955454157532,"snippet":"- **推荐**：aoao 修复（在去重键中加入 message.id）\n\n**#29855** - [Bug]: googlechat requireMention not functioning\n- **类型**：bug\n- **严重度**：中（配置失效）\n- **root cause**：`requireMention` 配置未生效\n- **影响**：GoogleChat 群组中必须显式 @ 机器人\n- **可修性**：S\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n**#29822** - Telegram: apiThrottler default config causes ~54s delays for group messages during block streaming\n- **类型**：bug\n- **严重度**：中（消息延迟）\n- **root cause**：默认 throttler 配置导致群组消息延迟\n- **影响**：Telegram 群组消息延迟 ~54 秒\n- **可修性**：M\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复（调整默认 throttler 配置）\n\n---\n\n## 2026-03-31 13:42 UTC 扫描\n\n### 扫描摘要\n- **时间范围**：2026-03-31 03:42 UTC → 13:42 UTC（过去 600 分钟）\n- **新 open issues**：8 个（已排除已覆盖项）\n- **新 open PRs**：~100 个\n- **状态**：发现 1 个 P1 级别问题，7 个 P2 级别问题\n\n### 关键发现\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1687-L1724","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1687-L1724"},{"id":"0b0d45